# PR 18 (stack18) replaced the botocore git submodule with vendored
# files in share/. CI workflows fetch botocore on the fly into
# `botocore/` for backwards compatibility with gen_classes.pl.
# Anchor with leading slash so this only matches the repo-root
# `botocore/` checkout dir and not the tracked `share/botocore/`
# vendored tree.
/botocore/

# share/smithy/ Smithy IR is vendored from awslabs/aws-sdk-rust at
# the SHA pinned in share/smithy/.upstream-sha. The .smithy.json
# files ARE tracked in git (so the dist ships them as-is, no
# build-time vendoring step required). Use `make vendor-smithy` to
# refresh the tree from upstream after bumping .upstream-sha.
#
# share/botocore/ gets populated by `make dist-prep` (see
# script/paws-vendor-botocore) immediately before `dzil build`.
# The populated content is large (~100MB raw) and regeneratable
# from upstream at the SHA pinned in share/botocore/.upstream-sha.
# Keep the tracked entries (.placeholder + .upstream-sha) so the
# layout documents itself.
/share/botocore/*
!/share/botocore/.placeholder
!/share/botocore/.upstream-sha

# Emacs save files:
*~
